WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.174
Today we will connect the form of a useful object to its function. Our work connects

00:00:05.174 --> 00:00:06.728
with our own local community.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:10.733
Observe the pot rim, body, base and any decoration.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:14.115
Draw the outline using simple curved lines.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:17.965
Add a label showing how the pot might be used.
